.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH oct-system-set-identity 1  "oct-system-set-identity " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
oct\-system\-set\-identity \- Change identity (Nitrokey Start only)
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBoct system set\-identity\fR <\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-card\fR> [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIidentity\fR> 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Change identity (Nitrokey Start only)
.PP
A Nitrokey Start device contains three distinct virtual OpenPGP cards, select the identity of the virtual card to activate.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-card\fR \fI<card ident>\fR
Identifier of the card to use
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fIidentity\fR>
Identity of the virtual card to activate
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
0
.IP \(bu 2
1
.IP \(bu 2
2
.RE
